{{--
  One thing that happened, in the conversation.

  A line, not a panel. An entry is a fact rather than authored content, and
  giving it the same box a comment gets makes a reader weigh "added the bug
  label" the same as three paragraphs of analysis. The conversation should still
  read as the conversation with these threaded through it.

  How it reads and which icon it takes are decided by `entrySentence` and
  `entryIcon` in `app/Actions/Issue/timeline`, where they are tested and where
  the issue timeline and the pull request timeline share them. A component
  cannot import, so the view has already called both.
--}}
<div class="timeline-event">
  <span class="{{ entry.icon }} timeline-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="muted">
    <strong class="timeline-actor">{{ entry.actor }}</strong>
    {{ entry.sentence }}
    {{ entry.when }}
  </span>
</div>

<style>
  .timeline-event {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 7px 4px 7px 2px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .timeline-icon { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 15px; height: 15px; color: var(--muted); }
  .timeline-actor { font-weight: 500; color: var(--text); }
</style>
